OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FIt will be a mostly cloudy day
OL,6,Fwith outbreaks of mostly light rain.
OL,7,FStill some good dry spells and perhaps
OL,8,Fsome brighter intervals breaking
OL,9,Fthrough in the afternoon. Breezy in
OL,10,Fthe west.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FCloudy start with occasional
OL,13,Flight rain, then becoming drier with
OL,14,Fsome clear spells this evening.
OL,15,FOvernight stays dry in east, but
OL,16,Fcloudier in west with a few showers.
OL,17,FRather cold.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
