OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FBright or sunny spells with
OL,6,Fthe odd shower possible at first in
OL,7,Fthe west. Becoming drier through the
OL,8,Fmorning to leave a dry afternoon with
OL,9,Fsunny spells.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FCloudy
OL,12,Fand breezy with heavy rain clearing to
OL,13,Fthe north later on Friday. Further
OL,14,Fspells of heavy rain over the weekend
OL,15,Fwith winds strengthening and bringing
OL,16,Fa risk of gales.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
